{"id":"500963","name":"豆腐虾仁鲜汤","author":"诗心乖乖","authorId":"616135","desc":"","cover":"images/500963/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豆腐","amount":"200g"},{"name":"虾仁","amount":"50克"},{"name":"油菜","amount":"3棵"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"8朵"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"小段"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"植物油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"8粒"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"各种食材洗净，备用。","img":"images/500963/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"豆腐掰碎，一定是掰碎，这样容易入味。油菜切丝，葱花切碎，香菇切片。虾去壳去头。","img":"images/500963/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"炒锅烧热加油，放入花椒、葱花爆香。","img":"images/500963/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入虾仁，炒红，炒香。","img":"images/500963/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入香菇片炒软。","img":"images/500963/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入豆腐，倒入盐、生抽，加少许水，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/500963/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入油菜丝，翻炒稍软。","img":"images/500963/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加适量水，烧开。","img":"images/500963/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"开吃","img":"images/500963/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"很想吃有木有💋","img":"images/500963/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"豆腐要手掰碎啊，不要切，这样好入味。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}